    "description": "<p>Lunar Exalted distract and confuse their foes to gain advantage. Butterfly Eyes Fist is an action calculated to evoke a specific reaction in the target--it might be a threatening feint or a single, startling word. The Lunar's player rolls (Manipulation + Presence) against a target within (Essence x 10) yards. If the roll achieves more successes than the target's Dodge Mental Defense Value, the Lunar bewilders the target and gets to dictate what combat action the target takes when the target is next able to act. The target may spend two points of Willpower to ignore this unnatural mental influence.</p>",
